[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:10.076
Which means
that we're just three days away

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.512
from finding out whether Boston
will be burned down

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.247 line:92%
