it will feature Team Ruff...

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.880 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.581 size:78% position:39% line:92%
...versus Team Fluff.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:49.349 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:51.718 size:78% position:39%
And if you're curious
